Package: cytoJointR
Title: Donor-Paired Joint Inference for Polyfunctional Cytokine Assays
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Mikhael", "Manurung", email = "mikhael.manurung@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bayesian inference on intracellular cytokine staining (ICS)
    flow cytometry data. Models exact Boolean marker patterns within donors,
    relative to each donor's matched control sample, across stimulations and
    visits, and derives signed net scores (magnitude, polyfunctionality,
    coordination) from aligned posterior draws. Includes a descriptive layer
    and an adapter to the 'COMPASS' package.
